meta-qti-base 
=================

OpenEmbedded/Yocto Project layer for QTI based platforms.


Dependencies
============

This layer depends on:

```
URI: git://github.com/openembedded/oe-core.git
layers: meta
```


Machines
========

Supported machines: sa6155, sa8155, sa8195 and qtiquingvm.


Maintenance
========
Layer maintainer: xubaoj <quic_xubaoj@quicinc.com>
Please see the MAINTAINERS file for information on contacting the
maintainers of this layer, as well as instructions for submitting patches.
